WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.324
Today is the final check. It takes about three minutes.

2
00:00:03.774 --> 00:00:10.307
First, a warm-up. Your child reads the story from yesterday once more, and marks the box for day ten.

3
00:00:10.757 --> 00:00:15.070
Then the check. Your child uses their page. You have the grown-up page.

4
00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:21.322
It has the same three parts as day one. Ten words. Four sentences. One long sentence.

5
00:00:21.772 --> 00:00:24.183
Do not help today, and do not use a timer.

6
00:00:24.883 --> 00:00:30.109
The four sentences matter most. Your child has never seen them, so memory cannot help.

7
00:00:30.559 --> 00:00:34.988
Write the three numbers on your page. Then put it beside the page from day one.

8
00:00:35.438 --> 00:00:39.636
Your page tells you what the result means, and exactly what to do next.

9
00:00:40.086 --> 00:00:44.754
Then scan the code at the top for the report. And let your child color the last star.
